      "value": "@{5aab30ea0b6da707273dbb98|full_name}: Ok all you can do is test the falloff in general with a second computer at hand. Once thats done you are back to the old gather some folks for testing game. I guess if you just playback a group talking on the other pc it is not the same since there is only one audio source instead of many overlapping sounds at various distances.",
